{
 "what": "Competition 2 opening n-gram: per-level model of the first M moves (D4-canonical), counted on FIT games, evaluated on INNER pseudo-questions (training data only, via tools/c10data.load_rows(part='fit'/'inner'); no validation games, no answer files). Exploration used to freeze M=12, alpha=20, aggregation 'mean', rule B for PREREG_02.",
